# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Safety net — content that must NEVER be committed, wherever it
# sits in the tree. The intended home for all of this is _local/.
# This backs up the _local/ convention: even a literature PDF,
# raw dataset, or photo dropped straight into code/ or figures/
# by mistake will be ignored automatically.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Literature PDFs
*.pdf

# Raw / large data
*.csv
*.tsv
*.txt
*.sim
*.dat
*.yml.bak
*.gz
*.zip
*.7z
*.nc
*.h5
*.parquet

# Photos (whiteboard / camera snaps — may contain faces or handwriting)
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Keep a few legitimate text files that match the patterns above
!requirements.txt
!**/requirements.txt
!LICENSE.txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# _local/ — everything here is local-only and gitignored
#   (literature PDFs, raw CSV/txt, OrcaFlex outputs, anything private/large)
# Exceptions: a README per subdir + .gitkeep so empty subdirs survive
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/_local/**
!/_local/data/
!/_local/data/README.md
!/_local/pdfs/
!/_local/pdfs/.gitkeep
